r;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/xBs65AGjqmVk7ZIumGW7ESZkes8h8PE4BVRgBljQiZ30ENobtHQGwUKcLb8WrLwL1QLqWhJYEwBlG1k7OzbRTZuxFjdVyouK3dRr9UYPwtqFwGfUqaw35cKFm1zQ1AGz\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 560px; border: 0; display: block; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;\"><div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666666; text-align: center; margin-top: 4px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 16px;\">Image by: Khalil Gerbeaux<\/div><\/div><\/figure><\/a>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Rolleston<\/strong>:<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">In 2016 we moved to our new home grounds at Foster Park in Rolleston. This fantastic space has 1 Senior, 2 Intermediate, 3 Junior and 12 First Kicks\/Fun Football fields all under lights, as well as an additional 3 Senior, 1 Youth Premier, 2 Intermediate and 3 Junior fields on the non-lit side of the park and now we also have a fully lit artificial turf with 1 senior or 2 intermediate or 4 junior fields.<br><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">The fields are located right next to the Selwyn Sports Centre, Broadlands Drive, Rolleston.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">We also have two senior fields at our old home ground Brookside Park, which is just down the road from Foster Park.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><em style=\"font-style: italic;\">Foster Park Field Map<\/em><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<a ses:no-track href=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/2000-constrained-2f591d86-f4f9-4423-a147-98c7370b3644\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: none; outline: none;\" class=\"hail-inline\" data-caption=\"\" data-grapher=\"\" data-width=\"1988\" data-height=\"2000\"><figure text-align=\"center\" data-hail-inline-id=\"DFp519a\" data-hail-inline-type=\"image\" data-hail-width-percentage=\"100\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><div class=\"email-image-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/1000-constrained-e511b4ed-a70b-46f5-b427-1af14a04d9ab\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 560px; border: 0; display: block; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;\"><\/div><\/figure><\/a>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><br><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><em style=\"font-style: italic;\">Brookside Park Field Map<\/em><\/p>\n\n<a ses:no-track href=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/2000-constrained-3f5f5f61-4480-46aa-9359-97f31f041f54\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: none; outline: none;\" class=\"hail-inline\" data-caption=\"\" data-grapher=\"\" data-width=\"2000\" data-height=\"1912\"><figure text-align=\"center\" data-hail-inline-id=\"jPRFdoQ\" data-hail-inline-type=\"image\" data-hail-width-percentage=\"100\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><div class=\"email-image-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 100%; max-width: 560px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/1000-constrained-0a7492d0-fbb7-42f9-8d97-fc010aae2529\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 560px; border: 0; display: block; outline: none; text-decoration: none; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;\"><\/div><\/figure><\/a>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; lin