:"Programmes","type":"folder","in_use":true,"display_homepage":true,"display_magazines":false,"display_gazettes":false,"display_newsletters":false,"display_noticeboards":false,"display_blogs":false,"display_yearbooks":false,"display_articles":false,"ordering_id":12124,"children":[{"id":"FRqr9lD","name":"Futsal","type":"link","in_use":true,"display_homepage":true,"display_magazines":false,"display_gazettes":false,"display_newsletters":false,"display_noticeboards":false,"display_blogs":false,"display_yearbooks":false,"display_articles":false,"ordering_id":11955,"association":{"type":"article","entity":{"id":"DQs5y4b","title":"Selwyn United Football Club Futsal Term 3 2026","author":"SUFC","show_author":true,"lead":"Register today to get involved with Selwyn United FC's Futsal training programme in 2026.","body":"<p>Selwyn United FC is running several Futsal training sessions in Term 3, for players aged 4 years old to 12 years old.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>Futsal is the five-a-side version of football and the world's fastest growing indoor sport.<\/p>\n\n<p>It's a small sided game played with a smaller, low bounce ball, on a netball sized court.<\/p>\n\n<p>Futsal combines fun, creativity, speed, technique, teamwork and quick thinking.<\/p>\n\n<p>Come along and learn how to play or improve your existing futsal skills, all levels welcome.<\/p>\n\n<h4><strong>Fun Futsal<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n<p>Fun Futsal is a great way to introduce players to the ever-growing indoor format of futsal and is a great way to work on football skills while making friends.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Time:<\/strong>&nbsp;4pm-5pm on Fridays<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Ages:<\/strong>&nbsp;5-10 years old<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Cost:<\/strong> $125.00 for the term | Friday 24th July 2026 to Friday 25th September 2026<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Where: <\/strong>Selwyn Sports Centre (70 Broadlands Dr)<\/p>\n\n<p>Any skill levels are welcome.<\/p>\n\n<p>To register <a href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/qmHmcK4CZsscm9Mt7\" data-button-colour=\"#1f57b5\" data-button=\"true\" class=\"button-link\" style=\"background-color: #1f57b5 !important;\">CLICK HERE<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<h4><strong>Mini Futsal<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n<p>Mini Futsal is a great way to increase your skill level for futsal and is a great way to work on your futsal skills while making friends.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Time:<\/strong>&nbsp;4pm-5pm on Tuesdays<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Ages:<\/strong>&nbsp;9 - 12 years old<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Cost:<\/strong> $125.00 for the term | Tuesday 21st July to Tuesday 22 September 2026<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Where: <\/strong>Selwyn Sports Centre (70 Broadlands Dr)<\/p>\n\n<p>Any skill levels are welcome.<\/p>\n\n<p>To register <a href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/TtDzDL83sTLCDDu8A\" data-button-colour=\"#1f57b5\" data-button=\"true\" class=\"button-link\" style=\"background-color: #1f57b5 !important;\">CLICK HERE<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>For more information, please email <a href=\"mailto:admin@sufc.nz\">admin@sufc.nz<\/a><\/p>","body_mail":"\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"516\">\n        <tr>\n        <td>\n        <![endif]-->\n        <div style=\"max-width: 516px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Selwyn United FC is running several Futsal training sessions in Term 3, for players aged 4 years old to 12 years old.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Futsal is the five-a-side version of football and the world's fastest growing indoor sport.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">It's a small sided game played with a smaller, low bounce ball, on a netball sized court.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Futsal combines fun, creativity, speed, technique, teamwork and quick thinking.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Come along and learn how to play or improve your existing futsal skills, all levels welcome.<\/p>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: bold;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Fun Futsal<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Fun Futsal is a great way to introduce players to the ever-growing indoor format of futsal and is a great way to work on football skills while making friends.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Time:<\/strong>&nbsp;4pm-5pm on Fridays<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Ages:<\/strong>&nbsp;5-10 years old<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Cost:<\/strong> $125.00 for the term | Friday 24th July 2026 to Friday 25th September 2026<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Where: <\/strong>Selwyn Sports Centre (70 Broadlands Dr)<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Any skill levels are welcome.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">To register <a ses:no-track href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/qmHmcK4CZsscm9Mt7\" data-button-colour=\"#1f57b5\" data-button=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #1f57b5;\" class=\"button-link\">CLICK HERE<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<h4 style=\"margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: bold;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Mini Futsal<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Mini Futsal is a great way to increase your skill level for futsal and is a great way to work on your futsal skills while making friends.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Time:<\/strong>&nbsp;4pm-5pm on Tuesdays<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Ages:<\/strong>&nbsp;9 - 12 years old<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Cost:<\/strong> $125.00 for the term | Tuesday 21st July to Tuesday 22 September 2026<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Where: <\/strong>Selwyn Sports Centre (70 Broadlands Dr)<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Any skill levels are welcome.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">To register <a ses:no-track href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/TtDzDL83sTLCDDu8A\" data-button-colour=\"#1f57b5\" data-button=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #1f57b5;\" class=\"button-link\">CLICK HERE<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">For more information, please email <a ses:no-track href=\"mailto:admin@sufc.nz\" style=\"color: #0366d6; text-decoration: underline;\">admin@sufc.nz<\/a><\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <\/td>\n        <\/tr>\n        <\/table>\n        <![endif]