se,"display_gazettes":false,"display_newsletters":false,"display_noticeboards":false,"display_blogs":false,"display_yearbooks":false,"display_articles":false,"ordering_id":22772,"association":{"type":"article","entity":{"id":"E04WTyS","title":"7th to 9th Grade Development Sessions","author":"Administration Manager","show_author":false,"lead":"Selwyn UFC will once again offer our 7th to 9th Grade Development Centre Sessions in Term 1 2026.","body":"<p>The Development Centre sessions are designed for players aged 7 years old to 9 years old who want a little extra training each week to improve their technical ability and foster their development.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>They are open to any players aged 7 years to 9 years old who want to enhance their skill development, the sessions are fun and inclusive to all. Come and play, learn and excel through football.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>If a player has the motivation to learn and be challenged, then these sessions may be just what you are looking for.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>The Development Centre program has been designed to provide players with basic football fundamentals that can be practiced in a fun environment. The Development Centre will also act as steppingstone into the Skill Centre, following the same focuses, however, scaled down to suit the age groups.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Development Centre Focuses:<\/p>\n\n<p>\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Ball Manipulation<\/p>\n\n<p>\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u20021v1 domination<\/p>\n\n<p>\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u20023v3-5v5 conditioned practice<\/p>\n\n<p>\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Small Sided Games<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>The sessions will be run on Tuesdays &amp; Thursdays 4pm to 5pm. Players can register for just one session or both sessions per week.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>Term 1 sessions will start on Tuesday 3rd February or Thursday 5th February 2026.<\/p>\n\n<p>Term 1 sessions will finish on Tuesday 31st March or Thursday 1st April 2026.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>To register for these sessions please <a href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/zRdu963gYZ31MfuZA\">CLICK HERE<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>For further information contact Chris Brown <a href=\"dof@sufc.nz\">dof@sufc.nz<\/a><\/p>","body_mail":"\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"516\">\n        <tr>\n        <td>\n        <![endif]-->\n        <div style=\"max-width: 516px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">The Development Centre sessions are designed for players aged 7 years old to 9 years old who want a little extra training each week to improve their technical ability and foster their development.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">They are open to any players aged 7 years to 9 years old who want to enhance their skill development, the sessions are fun and inclusive to all. Come and play, learn and excel through football.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">If a player has the motivation to learn and be challenged, then these sessions may be just what you are looking for.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">The Development Centre program has been designed to provide players with basic football fundamentals that can be practiced in a fun environment. The Development Centre will also act as steppingstone into the Skill Centre, following the same focuses, however, scaled down to suit the age groups.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Development Centre Focuses:<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Ball Manipulation<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u20021v1 domination<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u20023v3-5v5 conditioned practice<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">\u2022\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002Small Sided Games<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">The sessions will be run on Tuesdays &amp; Thursdays 4pm to 5pm. Players can register for just one session or both sessions per week.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Term 1 sessions will start on Tuesday 3rd February or Thursday 5th February 2026.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Term 1 sessions will finish on Tuesday 31st March or Thursday 1st April 2026.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">To register for these sessions please <a ses:no-track href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/zRdu963gYZ31MfuZA\" style=\"color: #0366d6; text-decoration: underline;\">CLICK HERE<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">For further information contact Chris Brown <a ses:no-track href=\"dof@sufc.nz\" style=\"color: #0366d6; text-decoration: underline;\">dof@sufc.nz<\/a><\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <\/td>\n        <\/tr>\n        <\/table>\n        <![endif]-->","date":"2026-01-14 00:47:00","show_date":true,"editable":false,"location":null,"location_latitude":null,"location_longitude":null,"status":"published","user":{"id":"gGARcL6","first_name":"Administration","last_name":"Manager","avatar_url":"","cw_admin":false,"last_active_date":"2026-06-30 05:16:24"},"created_date":"2024-12-16 00:47:18","updated_date":"2026-01-27 23:12:00","average_rating":0,"attachments":[],"sender_organisation":null,"attributed_article":null,"blocks":null,"default_description":"Selwyn UFC will once again offer our 7th to 9th Grade Development Centre Sessions in Term 1 2026....","org_name":"Selwyn United FC","website":true,"shared_to_app":false,"noindex":false,"deleted_date":null,"tags":[{"id":"deh6HEt","name":"Community","description":null},{"id":"cYDa1qI","name":"Development","description":null},{"id":"7dyJ3es","name":"Junior","description":null}],"private_tags":[],"short_gallery":[],"short_video_gallery":[],"hero_image":{"id":"WInELn0","caption":null,"people":null,"location":null,"location_latitude":null,"location_longitude":null,"date":"2022-05-25 02:29:56","editable":false,"photographer":"N Z Football","camera":null,"status":"approved","file_150_square_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/V0oAwwvpFFjBiWCwB7p7Dny8dkY4hDIZcRvh8qecjoOiwHVwIq7vQV3Akrr0jlD50gIOrIsYEksU6HCDlo1iEMaMV8RKnpmE8dytOu4gJtAaw45wfTAqOAuHc4UxGLk3","file_500_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/4iGCVSFJJG2fZKJgPP64v4GlYclc3fIHOWiFX1HCKwn2snlOzYFRaPWCrTbGEdyDF18z0WLgaENYTzfXgPm92aGEIs0Ph7iZhxBBsaJNYFd5ak3pYpJKHhJiYXqMayjb","file_500_square_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/gdLjzvh1P1ap9A2jkiVo8Fu9bbYFtPk8I0coegGRReFYtKpk8EOLxlVcFvWUyL2E0dFg9wnt11MqbND3ISGqkG0kI1RfsR4nLJ3lEPkDRFmMUy0zh7VBXIeaVCUnQeRc","file_1000_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/iPQ1DCj22TDZXYXoOOngjiWgRJs1mVmKZ19czP2Wpv9KLUIrlEtgrBui3nlXOM80sAccv1i5nO8g2LLgITNKCou65ZyhHfMNEy3mWfkf4iIF3s9ErKyqdEeA8KRI1F9X","file_1000_square_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/nTQtz4q9PbM2jGab39MNXL7EYjHPStKk4xMGFTKHUTlRmq1O8VeTB5nhK1Sxnfe0yYSyMHMr2twdIWcmDev6z9MnTCJlTdpi9BkWrk9PFttbLvXvjrCmVSrbAb7IgeI3","file_2000_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/vDHR20J1FsLlD1B9S1T46ztpl2iNiFYNqrlBxrLOYzM6K5gGZDLOLCSCRzbnpEEfWzOSLd85LegKERwFNwwsCJS4LFdPDnoI4WEuYerDwvAb82jwlCKqUCUSgGo2kfYw","file_original_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/1aHuLty0nMoVsdF8chfBgEa2oyi3MeS8q6EhAV8f9N1QtVvrtSeMkAxSKBpBTBMcU3UuyATkQDvEb84c95EhKkCoC2FDYTD88iK05U0wuvHMbBSXpMGIoy7Zt4vqyFOK","original_width":600,"original_height":200,"focal_point":null,"colour_palette":{"background":{"rgb":{"red":197,"green":211,"blue":214}},"primary":{"rgb":{"red":14,"green":14,"blue":14}},"secondary":{"rgb":{"red":102,"green":104,"blue":66}},"detail":{"rgb":{"red":164,"green":14,"blue":14}}},"tags":[],"private_tags":[],"user":{"id":"gGARcL6","first_name":"Administration","last_name":"Manager","avatar_url":"","cw_admin":false,"last_active_date":"2026-06-30 05:16:24"},"amnesty_expiry":"2022-05-26 02:29:56","created_date":"2022-05-25 02:29:57","average_rating":0,"sender_organisation":null,"attributed_image":null,"noindex":false,"deleted_date":null},"hero_video":null,"url":"https:\/\/hail.to\/selwyn\/article\/E04WTyS","hail_url":"https:\/\/hail.to\/selwyn\/article\/E04WTyS","order":null},"title":"7th to 9th Grade Development Sessions"},"depth":1,"parent":23921,"left":78,"right":79},{"id":"cjre0W0","name":"Skill Centre","type":"link","in_use":true,"display_homepage":true,"display_magazines":false,"display_gazettes":false,"display_newsletters":false,"display_noticeboards":false,"display_blogs":false,"display_yearbooks":false,"display_articles":false,"ordering_id":12126,"association":{"type":"article","entity":{"id":"ePQMToy","title":"Skill Centre","author":"Chris Brown","show_author":true,"lead":"The Selwyn United Skill Centre is a programme designed for 10th \u2013 12th Grade players who want to improve their technical ability with extra training sessions each week.","body":"<p>As a licensed club, Selwyn United FC has a strong commitment to developing junior and youth players. We have a range of programmes designed to meet varied needs.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Junior Development is not something reserved for 'elite' players. It is open to all and as a club we have a responsibility to work with any child that wants to explore the game of football more deeply and enhance their skill development.<br><\/p>\n\n<p>Our vision is to inspire participation by providing a football environment that is of the highest-quality, fun and inclusive to all regardless of a player\u2019s motivation or ability. There is no one individual more important than another. We are united as a club and as a community, with the purpose of providing opportunities for our community to enjoy, play, learn and excel through football.<br><\/p>\n\n<p>We also see development as something that goes well beyond simply playing the game. \u2018Good People First, Good Players Second\u2019.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>We very firmly believe in developing the person as well as producing the player and having a process that is based around the individual needs of our players and the development of attributes in their game, that will see them develop and succeed in whatever pathway is right for them.<\/p>\n\n<p>Players can choose to have one or two sessions per week (in addition to their regular Winter Season club team training session), sessions are held on Monday &amp; Tuesday, during school terms.<\/p>\n\n<p>Skill Centre is for players aged 10 years to 12 years who want a chance to further develop their football game. If a player has the motivation to learn and be challenged, then Skill Centre is available to foster that development.<\/p>\n\n<p>The cost for Skill Centre sessions:<\/p>\n\n<p>1 session per week $150 per term<\/p>\n\n<p>2 sessions per week $300 per term<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Skill Centre starts the week beginning Monday 2nd February 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>Training Schedule for Term 1<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>10th Grade<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">Tuesday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">Thursday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>11th Grade<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">Tuesday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">Thursday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><strong>12th Grade<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">Tuesday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">Thursday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/hP52tJQLAaNcgkm86\"><strong>To register your interest in having your daughter or son involved with the SUFC Skill Centre program please click this link<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\n<p><strong><em>*Please note that this link IS NOT a registration link. It is simply just registering an interest. Soon after completing the form you will receive an email with more information.*<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<a href=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/2000-constrained-a01660d1-295b-46cb-afd7-41944acd8cf9\" class=\"hail-inline\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-caption=\"\" data-people-html=\"\" data-grapher=\"\" data-width=\"2000\" data-height=\"2000\"><figure text-align=\"center\" data-hail-inline-id=\"jIcbRg2\" data-hail-inline-type=\"image\" data-hail-width-percentage=\"33.46774193548387\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"public-image-wrapper\" style=\"width: 33.46774193548387%;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/1000-constrained-ea42d8a0-dea7-40c4-b86c-cb24ff4d010a\"><\/div><\/figure><\/a>","body_mail":"\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"516\">\n        <tr>\n        <td>\n        <![endif]-->\n        <div style=\"max-width: 516px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">As a licensed club, Selwyn United FC has a strong commitment to developing junior and youth players. We have a range of programmes designed to meet varied needs.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Junior Development is not something reserved for 'elite' players. It is open to all and as a club we have a responsibility to work with any child that wants to explore the game of football more deeply and enhance their skill development.<br><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Our vision is to inspire participation by providing a football environment that is of the highest-quality, fun and inclusive to all regardless of a player\u2019s motivation or ability. There is no one individual more important than another. We are united as a club and as a community, with the purpose of providing opportunities for our community to enjoy, play, learn and excel through football.<br><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">We also see development as something that goes well beyond simply playing the game. \u2018Good People First, Good Players Second\u2019.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">We very firmly believe in developing the person as well as producing the player and having a process that is based around the individual needs of our players and the development of attributes in their game, that will see them develop and succeed in whatever pathway is right for them.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Players can choose to have one or two sessions per week (in addition to their regular Winter Season club team training session), sessions are held on Monday &amp; Tuesday, during school terms.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Skill Centre is for players aged 10 years to 12 years who want a chance to further develop their football game. If a player has the motivation to learn and be challenged, then Skill Centre is available to foster that development.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">The cost for Skill Centre sessions:<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">1 session per week $150 per term<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">2 sessions per week $300 per term<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Skill Centre starts the week beginning Monday 2nd February 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: bold;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Training Schedule for Term 1<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">10th Grade<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Tuesday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Thursday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">11th Grade<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Tuesday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Thursday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">12th Grade<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Tuesday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Thursday: 4pm-5pm \u2013 Foster Park turf<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><a ses:no-track href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/hP52tJQLAaNcgkm86\" style=\"color: #0366d6; text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>To register your interest in having your daughter or son involved with the SUFC Skill Centre program please click this link<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><em>*Please note that this link IS NOT a registration link. It is simply just registering an interest. Soon after completing the form you will receive an email with more information.*<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<a ses:no-track href=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/2000-constrained-a01660d1-295b-46cb-afd7-41944acd8cf9\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none; border: none; outline: none;\" class=\"hail-inline\" data-caption=\"\" data-grapher=\"\" data-width=\"2000\" data-height=\"2000\"><figure text-align=\"center\" data-hail-inline-id=\"jIcbRg2\" data-hail-inline-type=\"image\" data-hail-width-percentage=\"33.46774193548387\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><div class=\"email-image-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 33%; max-width: 187px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/1000-constrained-ea42d8a0-dea7-40c4-b86c-cb24ff4d010a\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 187px; border: 0