 within New Zealand.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">To ensure clarity, any team or individual representing Selwyn United must only wear official club-endorsed playing kit and off-field Selwyn United branded merchandise. No team or individual is permitted to procure or wear any non-official playing kit or merchandise while representing Selwyn United. &nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Use and Reproduction of Club Logo and Selwyn United Football Club name<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">The club logo, name and value statements, including all variations and designs, are copyright and trademarks of the club. They cannot be reproduced or used without written permission from the Board. This includes usage on third party websites, social media pages, merchandise, etc. A fee (usually by way of a sponsorship agreement) may apply for approved commercial use by third parties.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Sale of Club Merchandise&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Only merchandise and apparel officially licenced or produced through the club\u2019s supplier is approved to bear the club\u2019s logo, name or value statements. For the avoidance of doubt, use of the club logo, name or value statements for self-produced or self-sourced items sold by individuals or other parties is not permitted.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Enforcement and Disciplinary Action<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Failure to comply with this policy may result in disciplinary action. This includes requests to return items, cease the wearing of these when representing the club, potential club membership sanctions and legal action to cease unauthorised commercial usage of the logo.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">The Board will enforce this policy to maintain ownership and control of key club branding and assets.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;January 2025&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <\/td>\n        <\/tr>\n        <\/table>\n        <![endif]-->","date":"2025-02-19 23:17:29","show_date":true,"editable":false,"location":null,"location_latitude":null,"location_longitude":null,"status":"published","user":{"id":"gGARcL6","first_name":"Administration","last_name":"Manager","avatar_url":"","cw_admin":false,"last_active_date":"2026-06-30 05:16:24"},"created_date":"2025-02-19 23:17:29","updated_date":"2025-02-19 23:25:28","average_rating":0,"attachments":[],"sender_organisation":null,"attributed_article":null,"blocks":null,"default_description":"SUFC Playing Kit and Merchandise Policy","org_name":"Selwyn United FC","website":false,"shared_to_app":false,"noindex":false,"deleted_date":null,"tags":[],"private_tags":[],"short_gallery":[],"short_video_gallery":[],"hero_image":{"id":"J6cvxkE","caption":null,"people":null,"location":null,"location_latitude":null,"location_longitude":null,"date":"2025-01-09 22:00:17","editable":false,"photographer":null,"camera":null,"status":"approved","file_150_square_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/150x150-c84cbf85-7f2c-40d2-a6a2-47519e2df102","file_500_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/500-constrained-ecc6fede-8e03-4e03-9488-69a54ccae357","file_500_square_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/500x500-59e8d440-2eae-4652-a982-2f993e3a1912","file_1000_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/1000-constrained-2a26a98b-f4c2-4276-a6ae-0709e68c461e","file_1000_square_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/1000x1000-df270f7c-7d6e-4ea9-ac02-785fa88dc2b8","file_2000_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/2000-constrained-4c16cbf7-a1e1-495d-bea5-0ccfb0c8777e","file_original_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/original-ea9c38cf-be1a-43a6-9c5d-4e77355e76f5","original_width":972,"original_height":1234,"focal_point":null,"colour_palette":{"background":{"rgb":{"red":255,"green":255,"blue":255}},"primary":{"rgb":{"red":0,"green":0,"blue":0}},"secondary":{"rgb":{"red":0,"green":52,"blue":128}},"detail":{"rgb":{"red":103,"green":113,"blue":121}}},"tags":[],"private_tags":[],"user":{"id":"gGARcL6","first_name":"Administration","last_name":"Manager","avatar_url":"","cw_admin":false,"last_active_date":"2026-06-30 05:16:24"},"amnesty_expiry":"2025-01-10 22:00:17","created_date":"2025-01-09 22:00:18","average_rating":0,"sender_organisation":null,"attributed_image":null,"noindex":false,"deleted_date":null},"hero_video":null,"url":"https:\/\/hail.to\/selwyn\/article\/9RWorMZ","hail_url":"https:\/\/hail.to\/selwyn\/article\/9RWorMZ","order":null},"title":"SUFC Playing Kit and Merchandise Policy"},"depth":1,"parent":24852,"left":92,"right":93},{"id":"0TePMqo","name":"Payment Terms of Use","type":"link","in_use":true,"display_homepage":true,"display_magazines":true,"display_gazettes":true,"display_newsletters":true,"display_noticeboards":false,"display_blogs":true,"display_yearbooks":true,"display_articles":true,"ordering_id":10516,"association":{"type":"article","entity":{"id":"NFVmm58","title":"Payment Terms of Use","author":"General Manager","show_author":true,"lead":"Payment Terms of Use for MYCOMET","body":"<p>The words \"we\" and \"our\" where used in these Terms of Use mean Selwyn United Football Club Incorporated. Selwyn United Football Club allows members to pay for event costs and subscriptions through MyCOMET. As such, all transactions made via MyCOMET for Selwyn United Football Club administered events and subscriptions are subject to these Terms of Use.<\/p>\n\n<p>These Terms of Use are a contract between you and Selwyn United Football Club, separate to the conditions of membership. Please read these Terms of Use carefully. By making payment and registering to a Selwyn United Football Club administered event or subscription, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and accept these Terms of Use.<\/p>\n\n<p><b>1. Definitions<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>       1.1 - <b>MyCOMET<\/b> means the online member portal utilised to register and access the payment gateway.<\/p>\n\n<p>       1.2 - <b>Paymark<\/b> means the payment gateway used to make payment for products and services via MyCOMET.<\/p>\n\n<p>       1.3 - <b>Analyticom<\/b> - means Analyticom, the official national registration system provider for Selwyn United Football Club, and provider of MyCOMET.<\/p>\n\n<p>       1.4 - <b>Terms<\/b> means these Terms of Use.<\/p>\n\n<p>       1.5 - <b>Event<\/b> means any non-subscription based activity.<\/p>\n\n<p>       1.6 \u2013 <b>Subscription <\/b>means any membership fee payable <\/p>\n\n<p>       1.7 \u2013 <b>Fees <\/b>means the costs and\/or additional fees which may be payable for the use of Payment Services.<\/p>\n\n<p>       1.8 - <b>Online EFTPOS<\/b> refers to the method of payment directly from a mobile banking app.<\/p>\n\n<p>       1.9 - <b>Payment Services<\/b> means MyCOMET, and Paymark.<\/p>\n\n<p><b>2. Payment<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>       2.1 - Payment can be made via Credit \/ Debit card; Online EFTPOS (BNZ) 020860-0039650-01; Cheque; Online Selwyn UFC (BNZ) 020860-0039650-01<\/p>\n\n<p>       2.2 - Selwyn United Football Club is a New Zealand based organisation, with all transactions in New Zealand Dollars (NZD), unless explicitly outlined prior and\/or at point of purchase. All fees are in NZD and are inclusive of tax unless explicitly outlined at point of purchase.<\/p>\n\n<p>       2.3 - We may charge a Fee as advertised via Payment Services for their use.<\/p>\n\n<p><b>3. Use of Payment Services<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>       3.1 - You agree to not use MyCOMET for any improper, injurious, offensive or unlawful purpose.<\/p>\n\n<p>       3.2 - You will pay all Fees payable for the Payment Services at the time of the online transaction by credit card or Online EFTPOS. We reserve the right to amend any Fees from time to time, and to adjust any Fees recorded on the Payment Services if the price recorded is incorrect.<\/p>\n\n<p>       3.3 - If you are using a credit card, you represent and warrant that the credit card is issued in your name and that you shall pay to the credit card issuer all Fees incurred through the use of Payment Services. These charges may include card tokenisation and\/or transaction fees.<\/p>\n\n<p>       3.4 - Upon commencing a transaction through MyCOMET you will be presented with a confirmation screen verifying the transaction details you wish to process. It is your responsibility to verify that all transaction information and other details are correct. We shall have no liability for transactions which are incorrect as a result of inaccurate data entry in the course of providing Payment Services or for loss of data or information caused by factors outside of our control.<\/p>\n\n<p>       3.5 - We also use a payment gateway operated by Paymark for transactions incurred via MyCOMET. Paymark will collect information about you (including information about transactions processed by you) from time to time through Paymark. Any such information collected shall be treated in accordance with the Paymark Privacy Policy which can be found <a href=\"https:\/\/www.paymark.co.nz\/privacy-policy\/\"><b>HERE<\/b><\/a><b>.<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p><b>4. Refunds Policy<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>       4.1 - Refunds are at the sole discretion of Selwyn United Football Club. Any requests for refunds will require the authorisation of the board of Selwyn United Football Club. If your refund request is accepted, the refund will be transferred back to the originating credit card, nominated account, or held to your credit against future invoices. No cash refunds will be given.  In the case the Online Shop, this shall be dealt with in accordance with the Online Shop refund policy.<\/p>\n\n<p>       4.2 - In the case of an overpayment, a refund will only be provided when it has been proven that there has been an overpayment or where we are obliged to provide a refund by law. When applying for a refund you must provide us with proof of the overpayment or provide reasons why the refund should be made.<\/p>\n\n<p><b>5. Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>       5.1 - All merchandise deliveries are managed in accordance with the Online Shop Terms and Conditions.<\/p>\n\n<p><b>6. Security<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>       6.1 - SSL protocol (2048-bit) is used to encrypt all data transferred over the network. However, you acknowledge and agree that Internet transmissions are never entirely secure or private and that any message or information you send through MyCOMET (including credit card information) may be read or intercepted by others, even where MyCOMET, and Paymark, is stated as being secure. Neither we or Paymark shall have any liability for the interception or 'hacking' of data through the any of the aforementioned services by unauthorised third parties.<\/p>\n\n<p> <b>7. Limitation of Liability<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>       7.1 - We accept no liability or responsibility for the refusal or reversal of payments which are matters between you and your credit card provider.<\/p>\n\n<p>       7.2 - We cannot warrant that the E-Commerce Process, and\/or your use of our E-Commerce Services will be faultless, immediate, continuous, and virus free, nor that information provided through the E-Commerce Process will be complete, accurate or up to date. We will endeavour, however, to ensure the E-Commerce Services are available at all times, subject to maintenance.<\/p>","body_mail":"\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"516\">\n        <tr>\n        <td>\n        <![endif]-->\n        <div style=\"max-width: 516px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">\n        <p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">The words \"we\" and \"our\" where used in these Terms of Use mean Selwyn United Football Club Incorporated. Selwyn United Football Club allows members to pay for event costs and subscriptions through MyCOMET. As such, all transactions made via MyCOMET for Selwyn United Football Club administered events and subscriptions are subject to these Terms of Use.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">These Terms of Use are a contract between you and Selwyn United Football Club, separate to the conditions of membership. Please read these Terms of Use carefully. By making payment and registering to a Selwyn United Football Club administered event or subscription, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and accept these Terms of Use.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1. Definitions<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.1 - <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">MyCOMET<\/b> means the online member portal utilised to register and access the payment gateway.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.2 - <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Paymark<\/b> means the payment gateway used to make payment for products and services via MyCOMET.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.3 - <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Analyticom<\/b> - means Analyticom, the official national registration system provider for Selwyn United Football Club, and provider of MyCOMET.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.4 - <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Terms<\/b> means these Terms of Use.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.5 - <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Event<\/b> means any non-subscription based activity.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.6 \u2013 <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Subscription <\/b>means any membership fee payable <\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.7 \u2013 <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Fees <\/b>means the costs and\/or additional fees which may be payable for the use of Payment Services.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.8 - <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Online EFTPOS<\/b> refers to the method of payment directly from a mobile banking app.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       1.9 - <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Payment Services<\/b> means MyCOMET, and Paymark.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2. Payment<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       2.1 - Payment can be made via Credit \/ Debit card; Online EFTPOS (BNZ) 020860-0039650-01; Cheque; Online Selwyn UFC (BNZ) 020860-0039650-01<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       2.2 - Selwyn United Football Club is a New Zealand based organisation, with all transactions in New Zealand Dollars (NZD), unless explicitly outlined prior and\/or at point of purchase. All fees are in NZD and are inclusive of tax unless explicitly outlined at point of purchase.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       2.3 - We may charge a Fee as advertised via Payment Services for their use.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3. Use of Payment Services<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       3.1 - You agree to not use MyCOMET for any improper, injurious, offensive or unlawful purpose.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       3.2 - You will pay all Fees payable for the Payment Services at the time of the online transaction by credit card or Online EFTPOS. We reserve the right to amend any Fees from time to time, and to adjust any Fees recorded on the Payment Services if the price recorded is incorrect.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       3.3 - If you are using a credit card, you represent and warrant that the credit card is issued in your name and that you shall pay to the credit card issuer all Fees incurred through the use of Payment Services. These charges may include card tokenisation and\/or transaction fees.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       3.4 - Upon commencing a transaction through MyCOMET you will be presented with a confirmation screen verifying the transaction details you wish to process. It is your responsibility to verify that all transaction information and other details are correct. We shall have no liability for transactions which are incorrect as a result of inaccurate data entry in the course of providing Payment Services or for loss of data or information caused by factors outside of our control.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       3.5 - We also use a payment gateway operated by Paymark for transactions incurred via MyCOMET. Paymark will collect information about you (including information about transactions processed by you) from time to time through Paymark. Any such information collected shall be treated in accordance with the Paymark Privacy Policy which can be found <a ses:no-track href=\"https:\/\/www.paymark.co.nz\/privacy-policy\/\" style=\"color: #0366d6; text-decoration: underline;\"><b>HERE<\/b><\/a><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">.<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">4. Refunds Policy<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       4.1 - Refunds are at the sole discretion of Selwyn United Football Club. Any requests for refunds will require the authorisation of the board of Selwyn United Football Club. If your refund request is accepted, the refund will be transferred back to the originating credit card, nominated account, or held to your credit against future invoices. No cash refunds will be given.  In the case the Online Shop, this shall be dealt with in accordance with the Online Shop refund policy.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       4.2 - In the case of an overpayment, a refund will only be provided when it has been proven that there has been an overpayment or where we are obliged to provide a refund by law. When applying for a refund you must provide us with proof of the overpayment or provide reasons why the refund should be made.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">5. Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       5.1 - All merchandise deliveries are managed in accordance with the Online Shop Terms and Conditions.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">6. Security<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       6.1 - SSL protocol (2048-bit) is used to encrypt all data transferred over the network. However, you acknowledge and agree that Internet transmissions are never entirely secure or private and that any message or information you send through MyCOMET (including credit card information) may be read or intercepted by others, even where MyCOMET, and Paymark, is stated as being secure. Neither we or Paymark shall have any liability for the interception or 'hacking' of data through the any of the aforementioned services by unauthorised third parties.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"> <b style=\"font-weight: bold;\">7. Limitation of Liability<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       7.1 - We accept no liability or responsibility for the refusal or reversal of payments which are matters between you and your credit card provider.<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">       7.2 - We cannot warrant that the E-Commerce Process, and\/or your use of our E-Commerce Services will be faultless, immediate, continuous, and virus free, nor that information provided through the E-Commerce Process will be complete, accurate or up to date. We will endeavour, however, to ensure the E-Commerce Services are available at all times, subject to maintenance.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <\/td>\n        <\/tr>\n        <\/table>\n        <![endif]-->","date":"2019-04-17 04:10:58","show_date":true,"editable":false,"location":null,"location_latitude":null,"location_longitude":null,"status":"published","user":{"id":"gGARcL6","first_name":"Administration","last_name":"Manager","avatar_url":"","cw_admin":false,"last_active_date":"2026-06-30 05:16:24"},"created_date":"2019-04-17 04:10:58","updated_date":"2021-06-04 02:43:56","average_rating":0,"attachments":[],"sender_organisation":null,"attributed_article":null,"blocks":null,"default_description":"Payment Terms of Use for MYCOMET...","org_name":"Selwyn United FC","website":false,"shared_to_app":false,"noindex":false,"deleted_date":null,"tags":[],"private_tags":[],"short_gallery":[],"short_video_gallery":[],"hero_image":{"id":"quzKZeQ","caption":null,"people":null,"location":null,"location_latitude":null,"location_longitude":null,"date":"2019-04-20 22:59:57","editable":false,"photographer":"Darren Sudlow","camera":null,"status":"approved","file_150_square_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/bFWmayyJMRNKFhDI14Cnw9LBYpFVWhZiCyd2Hb4fCjLkO87aPhBCOATQ4RPAYXDr5HOULdHX7BqKzYtfxW4oNnDgYfIQbrI3bl3rcv0blnCzYmIqrQQfpYsjIiOKZtDz","file_500_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/S2Lszr6FNsXahP7Hht81vATrIPWpddOBOj7H7v46WaI2dIqIKVKFyIRNIB3dKYzDvXaYmvdXlHCvJQJwPxhR2CZCfYeQNH2y1blVtVBTygIRxE3MGcWOL6inxTselboM","file_500_square_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/1EBHku0eQ5XHtANoMIiB6n8UldudasQ1tcJrKz5Reg17iJve0NRlHSzMShPhtWOpJbyRPcIRnSWHqvCb5RhCjkXaR61X5JXiLW3Q47vqJ9f2FHu09Z58MR7Pk7CVmEt9","file_1000_url":"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/gh5SEYFBscn5KLHl68Bp2jevBt7beTyvRfsiaFdHlBbniwXGKmwS1Lg9ciXRWl5kTFQ51QG8Y5BlQxuhAQFJq3c1YwlSJOFcKNxqIJ3pIeAvVkHKyzVLHZeOC7P8jHbR","file_1000_sq