EtcqWeuSIQ8xslVgyFD7zojWc1nQjFBGNPBNgssdkjlAIzBzlfywBzo0cnL3cC72B1dPFG1YHfxAtlJSymlfO0L5131MzlmTf6L\" class=\"hail-inline\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-caption=\"\" data-people-html=\"\" data-grapher=\"Khalil Gerbeaux\" data-width=\"2000\" data-height=\"1217\"><figure text-align=\"center\" data-hail-inline-id=\"NLpy7PX\" data-hail-inline-type=\"image\" data-hail-width-percentage=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"public-image-wrapper\" style=\"width: %;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/xBs65AGjqmVk7ZIumGW7ESZkes8h8PE4BVRgBljQiZ30ENobtHQGwUKcLb8WrLwL1QLqWhJYEwBlG1k7OzbRTZuxFjdVyouK3dRr9UYPwtqFwGfUqaw35cKFm1zQ1AGz\"><figcaption style=\"text-align: center;\">Image by: Khalil Gerbeaux<\/figcaption><\/div><\/figure><\/a>\n\n<p><strong><br><\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Rolleston<\/strong>:<\/p>\n\n<p>In 2016 we moved to our new home grounds at Foster Park in Rolleston. This fantastic space has 1 Senior, 2 Intermediate, 3 Junior and 12 First Kicks\/Fun Football fields all under lights, as well as an additional 3 Senior, 1 Youth Premier, 2 Intermediate and 3 Junior fields on the non-lit side of the park and now we also have a fully lit artificial turf with 1 senior or 2 intermediate or 4 junior fields.<br><\/p>\n\n<p>The fields are located right next to the Selwyn Sports Centre, Broadlands Drive, Rolleston.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>We also have two senior fields at our old home ground Brookside Park, which is just down the road from Foster Park.<\/p>\n\n<p><em>Foster Park Field Map<\/em><\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<a href=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/2000-constrained-2f591d86-f4f9-4423-a147-98c7370b3644\" class=\"hail-inline\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-caption=\"\" data-people-html=\"\" data-grapher=\"\" data-width=\"1988\" data-height=\"2000\"><figure text-align=\"center\" data-hail-inline-id=\"DFp519a\" data-hail-inline-type=\"image\" data-hail-width-percentage=\"100\" style=\"text-align: center;\">