nt methodology.<\/em><\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>General Manager: Dana Lauren | generalmanager@sufc.nz<\/p>\n\n<p><em>Dana manages our off field operations and arranges the delivery of our football products.<\/em><\/p>\n\n<p><br><\/p>\n\n<h3>Board<\/h3>\n\n<p>Club President:&nbsp;Stan de Rooy | pres@sufc.nz<\/p>\n\n<p>Trustee: Michelle Marshall | admin@sufc.nz<\/p>\n\n<p>Trustee: John Antcliffe | john@sufc.nz<\/p>\n\n<p>Trustee: Justin McLeod | <a href=\"mailto:justin@sufc.nz\">justin@sufc.nz<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p>Trustee: Ellie Coshall | <a href=\"mailto:ellie@sufc.nz\">ellie@sufc.nz<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p>Trustee: Alex Smith | alex@sufc.nz<\/p>\n\n<h3>Life Members<\/h3>\n\n<p>Jym Findlay (2015)<\/p>\n\n<p>Andrew Harper (2016)<\/p>\n\n<p>Martin Allen (2016)<\/p>\n\n<p>Gerard de Rooy (2017)<\/p>\n\n<p>Tania McKay (2019)<\/p>\n\n<p>Lee Padmore (2019)<\/p>\n\n<p>Michelle Marshall (2020)<\/p>\n\n<p>Vince Binding (2023)<\/p>\n\n<p>Chris Leggett (2023)<\/p>\n\n<p>Stan de Rooy (2023)<\/p>","body_mail":"\n        <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n        <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"516\">\n        <tr>\n        <td>\n        <![endif]-->\n        <div style=\"max-width: 516px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: bold;\">Management<\/h3>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">Administration Manager: Michelle Marshall | admin@sufc.nz<br><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><em style=\"font-style: italic;\">Michelle handles all general administrative tasks and the clubs finances. She is the glue that keeps things together and ticking along.<\/em><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\"><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; line-heigh