nity, you can now sponsor a team playing strip in our new Paladin playing kit.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>Your logo will be on the front of the playing shirts and will be used for three years. The kit remains the property of Selwyn United FC and we guarantee it will be worn during the winter football season for at least three years.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>To sponsor a Senior team strip consisting of 17 shirts, 17 shorts, 1 goalie shirt and 1 pair goalie shorts will cost you <strong>$2,200.00<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>To sponsor a Youth team strip consisting of 16 playing shirts, 16 playing shorts, 1 goalie shirt &amp; 1 pair goalie shorts will cost you <strong>$2,100.00.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>To sponsor a Junior team strip consisting of 13 playing shirts, 13 playing shorts, 1 goalie shirt and 1 pair goalie shorts will cost you <strong>$1,750.00<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>There is an eight week turnaround from confirmation of the order.<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n<p>If you would like to sponsor a team strip or would like further details, please email <a href=\"mailto:admin@sufc.nz\">admin@sufc.nz<\/a><\/p>\n\n<a href=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/2000-constrained-b1d93faf-7566-4ab1-aca5-f3b8e6b458ea\" class=\"hail-inline\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-caption=\"\" data-people-html=\"\" data-grapher=\"\" data-width=\"2000\" data-height=\"1200\"><figure text-align=\"center\" data-hail-inline-id=\"BdM4Jzi\" data-hail-inline-type=\"image\" data-hail-width-percentage=\"100\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"public-image-wrapper\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/assets.hail-cdn.com\/uploads\/1000-constrained-82007d71-98b9-424c-b6b6-23dab0acdb7b\"><\/div><\/figure><\/a>","date":"2025-02-19 04:09:00","show_date":true,"location":null,"location_latitude":null,"location_longitude":null,"status":"published","created_date":"2025-02-04 04:09:25","updated_date":"2025-02-20 04:47:33","average_rating":0,"attachm